this repo's ledger is laid out by canon 0.29 (5 record file(s) named by the 0.29 rule, e.g. `kind=evidence_record/cart.add.01__567170f5e757.json`, `kind=evidence_record/cart.add.01__c17ba25cb2c0.json`, `kind=evidence_record/cart.add.02__bc24e7fea2f9.json`); canon 0.30 does not use those files for any judgement. Hint: run `canon migrate --json` to preview the move (a bare run only previews; `--commit --plan-digest <digest>` applies it)
